'''Stoneglove''' is a spell that coats the caster's hand in a rock-like casing. As such, this spell can be used to amplify a punch or to protect the caster's hand. When manifested, this spell emits a green aura. 

== History ==
Outside the sunken city of [[Atlantis]], this spell was used by [[Dante Vale]] to rescue [[Cherit]] from a shark that attempted to eat the Titan by holding the shark's mouth open and then punching the shark. {{source|Coming of Age}}

During [[Sophie Casterwill]]'s tests at the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], [[Lok Lambert]] manifested Stoneglove with the intent of using it to prevent a Casterwill spike trap around a lever. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

Dante Vale used Stoneglove alongside [[Doublespell]] to firmly grab [[the Betrayer]], allowing Cherit to expose the Spiral symbol on his back and subsequently making it so Lok Lambert could strike it with the [[Willblade]], finally defeating the Betrayer. {{Source|Dante's Return}}

